<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Display Background Image</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background: url('{backgroundImage}') no-repeat;
            background-size: cover;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <button onclick="displayBackgroundImage()">Display Background Image</button>
    <script>
        function displayBackgroundImage() {
            const backgroundImage = window.getComputedStyle(document.body).backgroundImage;
            document.body.style.backgroundImage = backgroundImage;
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Display Background Image</title>
    <style>
        body {
            text-align: center;
        }

        button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <button id="display-background">Display Background Image</button>
    <script>
        document.getElementById('display-background').addEventListener('click', () => {
            const backgroundImage = chrome.tabs.query({ active: true, currentWindow: true }, tabs => tabs[0].url).split('?')[0];
            chrome.runtime.sendMessage({ action: 'show_background_image', url: backgroundImage });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

