\section{Issue Description}
We are experiencing issues with the integration of a third-party API within our multi-tiered system architecture. The API is not responding properly, and we are encountering error messages and codes. We have attached relevant logs and screenshots to this ticket for your reference.

\section{Proposed Solution/Workaround}
We propose to temporarily disable the affected API integration and investigate the issue further. We will also explore alternative APIs or integration methods to ensure seamless system operation.

\section{Timeline for Resolution}
We aim to resolve this issue within 24 hours. However, if the problem requires more extensive investigation or involves multiple systems, the resolution time may be extended.

\section{System Architecture Table}
\begin{table}[h]
\centering
\begin{tabularx}{\textwidth}{|X|X|X|}
\hline
\textbf{Tier} & \textbf{Component} & \textbf{Description} \\ \hline
1 & Client & Web browser or mobile app \\ \hline
2 & Application Server & Processes user requests and interacts with the database \\ \hline
3 & Database Server & Stores and manages data \\ \hline
4 & Third-Party API & Provides external data or services \\ \hline
\end{tabularx}
