```javascript
const words = ["skyscraper", "chair", "umbrella", "curtain"];
const organizedWords = [];

words.forEach(word => {
  const length = word.length;
  organizedWords.push({ word, length });
});

const jsonData = JSON.stringify(organizedWords);
console.log(jsonData);
```
The output will be:
